  "2026-07-27T05:36:41.562Z","harness:codex","Live dependency disposition 2026-07-27: npm-package-arg 14.0.0 still requires Node ^22.22.2 || ^24.15.0 || >=26 while pm promises >=22.18.0. Dependabot PR #761 was closed with this PM link after all checks and bot reports were acknowledged; no package change or accidental runtime-floor narrowing was made."
